  "version": "0.8.2-beta.1",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.8.1`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- stop WebGL terminals from suddenly drawing pieces of other glyphs: addon-webgl 0.19 counts each atlas page's version from zero, so after the shared atlas merges pages a different page can land at an index with the same small version, and a terminal keeps drawing from the old texture with the new page's glyph positions; a Vite transform makes page versions one global counter, as the 0.20 betas do, and fails the build if an upgraded addon no longer has the code it rewrites ([5a7e90ba](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5a7e90bab5e264c67f59cd914cdd6019f7bf3c73))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.8.1...v0.8.2-beta.1](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.8.1...v0.8.2-beta.1)",
